WEBVTT

00:06.980 --> 00:08.980
<b>BAKUMATSU ERA
KYOTO</b>

00:43.930 --> 00:45.600
<b>There is no need to worry.</b>

00:46.100 --> 00:49.980
<b>After all, I am the Captain
of the First Unit of the Shinsengumi.</b>

00:49.980 --> 00:53.190
<b>But your lungs are ailing now,
aren't they?</b>

00:54.820 --> 00:56.820
<b>I will slay him.</b>

01:11.170 --> 01:15.170
<b>Captain of the Third Unit
of the Shinsengumi, Hajime Saito...</b>

01:17.090 --> 01:17.970
<b>Here I come...</b>

01:17.970 --> 01:20.220
<b>Hitokiri Battosai.</b>

02:53.020 --> 02:57.030
<b>EPISODE 1: KENSHIN • HIMURA BATTOSAI</b>

03:01.990 --> 03:04.410
<b>11th YEAR OF MEIJI
DOWNTOWN TOKYO</b>

03:06.120 --> 03:07.290
<b>Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

03:09.710 --> 03:10.920
<b>I finally found you!</b>

03:11.670 --> 03:14.880
<b>Your killing spree ends tonight!
Prepare yourself!</b>

03:15.090 --> 03:15.920
<b>Oro?</b>

03:16.050 --> 03:16.880
<b>Don't play dumb!</b>

03:16.880 --> 03:19.300
<b>Nobody else would walk around
with a sword late at night,</b>

03:19.300 --> 03:21.260
<b>completely ignoring
the Sword Abolishment Act!</b>

03:29.520 --> 03:30.940
<b>Ouch.</b>

03:31.440 --> 03:32.650
<b>Well, that was easy.</b>

03:33.150 --> 03:35.110
<b>Is this the rumored Hitokiri Battosai?</b>

03:35.730 --> 03:36.940
<b>Rurouni.</b>

03:38.610 --> 03:40.650
<b>I am nothing more than a rurouni,</b>

03:40.650 --> 03:43.360
<b>a swordsman on a journey
with no destination, that I am.</b>

03:43.610 --> 03:45.740
<b>I have just arrived in this town.</b>

03:45.740 --> 03:48.240
<b>You say, "Killing spree,"
but I have no clue—</b>

03:48.240 --> 03:50.080
<b>Then what is that at your hip?</b>

03:50.080 --> 03:53.460
<b>Even if you're a swordsman,
you're not allowed to carry a blade!</b>

03:58.670 --> 03:59.760
<b>What is this?</b>

04:00.340 --> 04:01.510
<b>A Sakabato?</b>

04:02.010 --> 04:04.800
<b>Can you kill someone with this blade,
that you can?</b>

04:05.850 --> 04:07.010
<b>You can't.</b>

04:07.930 --> 04:11.180
<b>In the first place, there are
no nicks at all on this reverse blade,</b>

04:11.180 --> 04:13.690
<b>nor any smell of blood
or clouding from oil.</b>

04:13.690 --> 04:15.690
<b>It's as good as new.</b>

04:16.770 --> 04:18.940
<b>You really are just a...</b>

04:19.480 --> 04:21.110
<b>Rurouni, I am.</b>

04:21.110 --> 04:23.860
<b>But why do you carry such a useless sword?</b>

04:25.490 --> 04:26.320
<b>The police!</b>

04:26.530 --> 04:27.910
<b>This time, for sure!</b>

04:32.330 --> 04:35.750
<b>It seems something is going on,
that it is.</b>

04:37.840 --> 04:38.790
<b>Weak!</b>

04:38.920 --> 04:41.630
<b>Weak, weak, weak!</b>

04:41.920 --> 04:43.840
<b>You all are too weak!</b>

04:44.010 --> 04:46.050
<b>H-He's too strong!</b>

04:46.550 --> 04:48.050
<b>This strength is indeed...</b>

04:48.390 --> 04:51.520
<b>that of the rumored Battosai!</b>

04:52.850 --> 04:54.940
<b>Stop right, there, Battosai!</b>

05:00.900 --> 05:01.730
<b>Oh, no—</b>

05:09.410 --> 05:11.450
<b>You are a reckless one, that you are.</b>

05:11.450 --> 05:12.290
<b>Rurouni.</b>

05:18.330 --> 05:20.960
<b>Over here! The bandit is over here!</b>

05:23.050 --> 05:24.510
<b>I am the Battosai!</b>

05:25.050 --> 05:28.140
<b>Himura Battosai of the Kamiya Kasshin-ryu,</b>

05:28.140 --> 05:31.260
<b>people call me Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

05:31.390 --> 05:32.220
<b>Wait!</b>

05:33.270 --> 05:36.100
<b>Wait, what are you doing? Let me down!</b>

05:36.100 --> 05:38.770
<b>Pursuing too long while injured
may be fatal, that it may be.</b>

05:39.150 --> 05:41.480
<b>He's already claimed
to be of a certain sword style,</b>

05:41.480 --> 05:42.320
<b>so don't fret—</b>

05:42.320 --> 05:44.740
<b>Kamiya Kasshin-ryu is our sword style!</b>

05:45.030 --> 05:48.070
<b>He's using our name
to commit crossroad killings!</b>

05:48.990 --> 05:49.950
<b>Let me down!</b>

05:50.240 --> 05:51.990
<b>I'm gonna go catch him right now—</b>

05:51.990 --> 05:54.160
<b>You won't catch up if you go now,
that you can't.</b>

05:54.410 --> 05:56.370
<b>Before the police
start investigating us,</b>

05:56.370 --> 05:57.830
<b>we should depart, that we should.</b>

05:57.830 --> 05:59.670
<b>Let me down!</b>

06:04.300 --> 06:07.510
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN-RYU</b>

06:05.340 --> 06:07.510
<b>Kamiya Kasshin-ryu...</b>

06:09.890 --> 06:14.220
<b>ACTING MASTER</b>

06:09.890 --> 06:14.430
<b>KAORU KAMIYA</b>

06:09.890 --> 06:14.430
<b>STUDENT</b>

06:10.090 --> 06:12.600
<b>Acting Master, Kaoru Kamiya.</b>

06:13.060 --> 06:14.350
<b>Students...</b>

06:14.430 --> 06:16.230
<b>STUDENT</b>

06:15.350 --> 06:16.180
<b>Oro?</b>

06:16.810 --> 06:19.230
<b>We were
a very small sword style to begin with.</b>

06:19.810 --> 06:24.440
<b>But we used to have about ten students
and were working together really hard.</b>

06:25.070 --> 06:29.280
<b>But two months ago, that guy
suddenly started crossroad killings,</b>

06:29.280 --> 06:30.570
<b>and look how it is now.</b>

06:31.530 --> 06:34.870
<b>All the students left,
fearing the name "Battosai,"</b>

06:34.870 --> 06:38.290
<b>and nobody in town
wants to even come close to our dojo.</b>

06:39.000 --> 06:42.500
<b>Hitokiri Battosai,
even now in the Meiji Era,</b>

06:42.500 --> 06:44.210
<b>is still feared by people.</b>

06:45.460 --> 06:47.720
<b>Why does he claim to be
of the Kamiya Kasshin-ryu?</b>

06:48.220 --> 06:51.340
<b>Is he really the Battosai? I have no idea.</b>

06:51.840 --> 06:55.350
<b>But I have to end his atrocity
as soon as possible.</b>

06:56.770 --> 06:57.770
<b>I see.</b>

06:58.890 --> 07:02.560
<b>But it's better if you didn't walk around
at night anymore, that it is.</b>

07:02.690 --> 07:03.520
<b>Huh?</b>

07:03.520 --> 07:06.440
<b>That man is far stronger than you are,
Miss Kaoru.</b>

07:06.440 --> 07:07.280
<b>What?</b>

07:07.280 --> 07:10.030
<b>Being able to acknowledge
when others are stronger than yourself</b>

07:10.030 --> 07:11.570
<b>is part of being a swordsman.</b>

07:12.070 --> 07:15.410
<b>It should be obvious
how your next clash will end?</b>

07:16.370 --> 07:18.620
<b>The pride of a sword style
is not important enough</b>

07:18.620 --> 07:20.960
<b>as to risk your life to protect it,
that it isn't.</b>

07:24.040 --> 07:25.790
<b>The Kamiya Kasshin-ryu...</b>

07:27.250 --> 07:31.430
<b>The Kamiya Kasshin-ryu is a sword style
my father created in the Meiji Era</b>

07:31.430 --> 07:34.430
<b>after surviving
the turbulence of the Bakumatsu Era.</b>

07:35.260 --> 07:37.720
<b>My father didn't approve
of murderous swords.</b>

07:37.720 --> 07:40.310
<b>With an ambition
for swords that give life,</b>

07:40.310 --> 07:43.100
<b>he was giving it everything he had
for ten years.</b>

07:44.020 --> 07:46.650
<b>But even he was sent out to the Seinan War</b>

07:46.650 --> 07:51.320
<b>as part of the Metropolitan Police's
swordsman squad,</b>

07:51.320 --> 07:56.370
<b>and in a place that was so distant
from his own ideals, he left this world.</b>

07:57.330 --> 08:02.540
<b>That man claiming to be Hitokiri Battosai
uses that name of Kamiya Kasshin-ryu</b>

08:02.540 --> 08:05.210
<b>and has already caused
over ten injuries and fatalities.</b>

08:06.290 --> 08:08.880
<b>My father's heirloom sword style,
the Kamiya Kasshin-ryu,</b>

08:08.880 --> 08:11.300
<b>idealizes a life-giving sword.</b>

08:11.300 --> 08:13.340
<b>But it has been tarnished
by a murderous sword!</b>

08:14.050 --> 08:15.720
<b>You're merely a rurouni!</b>

08:15.720 --> 08:18.060
<b>You wouldn't understand
the frustration I'm feeling!</b>

08:25.560 --> 08:28.070
<b>However, in either case, with that arm,</b>

08:28.070 --> 08:30.280
<b>you can't make the rounds at night,
that you can't.</b>

08:31.280 --> 08:33.570
<b>It's best if you stay on the safe side.</b>

08:34.240 --> 08:37.620
<b>In the first place,
someone seeking a life-giving sword</b>

08:37.620 --> 08:41.370
<b>being unable to live her own life
is no joke, that it isn't.</b>

08:42.410 --> 08:46.580
<b>Besides, your late father
wouldn't wish his sword style</b>

08:46.580 --> 08:51.670
<b>to be protected at the cost
of his daughter's life, that he doesn't.</b>

08:52.880 --> 08:53.720
<b>Excuse me.</b>

08:56.340 --> 08:58.510
<b>Now we're all done.</b>

08:58.510 --> 09:00.100
<b>Thank you, Kihei.</b>

09:00.560 --> 09:04.230
<b>Kaoru, you shouldn't open up
to someone like that.</b>

09:04.730 --> 09:08.310
<b>A rurouni is nothing more
than a failure in life.</b>

09:08.900 --> 09:09.770
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:09.770 --> 09:13.150
<b>You are too nice for your own good.</b>

09:14.780 --> 09:15.610
<b>I know.</b>

09:19.120 --> 09:20.410
<b>I know that.</b>

09:22.080 --> 09:25.080
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

09:25.080 --> 09:27.290
<b>A FEW DAYS LATER</b>

09:30.000 --> 09:31.170
<b>Hey, don't thrash about!</b>

09:31.170 --> 09:32.050
<b>Behave!</b>

09:32.300 --> 09:34.170
<b>Oh? Did someone get caught?</b>

09:38.390 --> 09:39.850
<b>Ororo...</b>

09:40.300 --> 09:41.350
<b>Rurouni!</b>

09:41.850 --> 09:43.810
<b>What did this man do?</b>

09:44.560 --> 09:47.480
<b>As you can see,
he's disobeying the Sword Abolishment Act!</b>

09:47.480 --> 09:49.520
<b>Hmm? If I recall, you're...</b>

09:49.770 --> 09:52.020
<b>from the dojo with Hitokiri Battosai—</b>

09:52.020 --> 09:54.150
<b>I'm telling you that's a false accusation!</b>

09:54.150 --> 09:56.490
<b>What, are you going to fight back
against an officer?</b>

09:56.490 --> 09:58.610
<b>"Officer" this! "Officer" that!
Don't act so big!</b>

09:58.610 --> 10:01.830
<b>- What?
- Now, now. Please don't get so angry.</b>

10:01.830 --> 10:04.370
<b>Let's peacefully settle this.</b>

10:06.620 --> 10:07.460
<b>Hey.</b>

10:09.460 --> 10:11.670
<b>Out of respect for the geezer,
we'll tolerate him.</b>

10:12.130 --> 10:13.550
<b>You won't get away next time.</b>

10:16.670 --> 10:18.720
<b>I have been spared thanks to you,
that I have.</b>

10:18.840 --> 10:20.720
<b>You're welcome.</b>

10:20.720 --> 10:24.060
<b>You're still in this town?</b>

10:24.060 --> 10:25.770
<b>Do you have something to do here?</b>

10:25.930 --> 10:27.310
<b>No, not really.</b>

10:28.440 --> 10:32.110
<b>Anyway, what happened
to that crossroad killer's case?</b>

10:32.110 --> 10:35.480
<b>Yes. I have leads
on who the perpetrator might be.</b>

10:35.940 --> 10:38.570
<b>There is another swordsmanship dojo
in the neighboring town.</b>

10:38.570 --> 10:39.410
<b>Oh?</b>

10:39.610 --> 10:41.910
<b>To be precise, it's a former dojo.</b>

10:41.910 --> 10:44.870
<b>Nowadays it's a hangout
for gamblers and thugs.</b>

10:45.120 --> 10:49.330
<b>And apparently a has-been samurai
swordsman took control two months ago.</b>

10:49.830 --> 10:54.130
<b>That guy is said to be huge,
close to six and a half feet.</b>

10:54.340 --> 10:56.170
<b>See? Doesn't that sound fishy?</b>

10:56.170 --> 10:58.800
<b>The crossroad killings started
around two months ago, too.</b>

10:59.010 --> 11:00.970
<b>By an adept swordsman
who is about that tall.</b>

11:01.220 --> 11:03.720
<b>Huge guys like that aren't that common!</b>

11:03.720 --> 11:08.390
<b>Miss Kaoru, I have to prepare dinner,
so I will get going now.</b>

11:08.390 --> 11:10.440
<b>Oh, right. Thanks.</b>

11:10.440 --> 11:11.270
<b>See you.</b>

11:14.520 --> 11:16.530
<b>And how is that man related—</b>

11:16.530 --> 11:20.030
<b>Kihei? He's like a live-in servant.</b>

11:20.400 --> 11:22.490
<b>It was right after my father passed away.</b>

11:22.870 --> 11:25.120
<b>I found him lying on the street
in front of our dojo</b>

11:25.120 --> 11:26.540
<b>and nursed him back to health.</b>

11:26.990 --> 11:28.870
<b>He gets worried about me</b>

11:28.870 --> 11:32.040
<b>and tells me I should sell off the dojo
and live in peace.</b>

11:32.040 --> 11:33.080
<b>His background?</b>

11:33.080 --> 11:34.630
<b>I don't know, because I never asked.</b>

11:34.630 --> 11:36.500
<b>You are too carefree, that you are.</b>

11:36.500 --> 11:37.590
<b>Oh, is that so?</b>

11:38.510 --> 11:39.340
<b>It's all right.</b>

11:39.840 --> 11:42.760
<b>It's not surprising for anyone
to have one or two tales of the past</b>

11:42.760 --> 11:44.550
<b>that they don't want to tell anyone about.</b>

11:44.760 --> 11:46.680
<b>I can say the same for you, right?</b>

11:46.680 --> 11:48.220
<b>Isn't that why you are a rurouni?</b>

11:53.230 --> 11:54.980
<b>You are correct, that you are.</b>

11:55.310 --> 11:58.400
<b>Hey, rurouni, you don't have
enough money for an inn, right?</b>

11:58.400 --> 11:59.990
<b>Then why don't you stay at our place?</b>

11:59.990 --> 12:03.490
<b>I have errands to run,
so I will be back another day.</b>

12:04.820 --> 12:05.700
<b>Oh, wait.</b>

12:06.700 --> 12:07.830
<b>Is there something else?</b>

12:08.790 --> 12:09.750
<b>Um, well...</b>

12:10.250 --> 12:12.790
<b>the other day, well...</b>

12:13.250 --> 12:15.540
<b>I didn't get to say thank you
for helping me,</b>

12:15.540 --> 12:18.250
<b>and then saying
you were merely a rurouni...</b>

12:19.000 --> 12:19.840
<b>well, um...</b>

12:21.510 --> 12:22.630
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

12:23.220 --> 12:24.840
<b>Do you have a fever, that you do?</b>

12:25.340 --> 12:27.810
<b>I'm making an effort to apologize here!</b>

12:27.810 --> 12:29.680
<b>Oh, that's what it was, I see.</b>

12:30.640 --> 12:33.940
<b>Rurouni do not care
about the little things.</b>

12:34.230 --> 12:37.270
<b>You should not worry about them either,
Miss Kaoru, that you shouldn't.</b>

12:40.530 --> 12:43.530
<b>Thinking about it,
what errand does he have?</b>

12:45.490 --> 12:47.740
<b><i>A dojo in the neighboring town.</i></b>

12:48.950 --> 12:52.660
<b><i>No wonder I couldn't find them
when I searched this town.</i></b>

12:55.330 --> 12:57.840
<b>Pardon me! Excuse me!</b>

12:57.840 --> 13:00.250
<b>KIHEIKAN</b>

12:58.000 --> 13:00.590
<b>Pardon me! Excuse me!
Pardon me! Excuse me! Pardon—</b>

13:00.590 --> 13:02.970
<b>Shut up! Who the hell are you?</b>

13:02.970 --> 13:04.470
<b>The leader of this place—</b>

13:04.470 --> 13:07.600
<b>Mr. Hiruma is not here right now!
Come back another time!</b>

13:08.010 --> 13:11.310
<b>Oh ho! So his name is Hiruma, that he is.</b>

13:11.310 --> 13:13.810
<b>You came here not knowing that, punk?</b>

13:13.810 --> 13:16.020
<b>Oh, I had totally assumed...</b>

13:16.810 --> 13:19.480
<b>his name was Crossroad Killer Battosai.</b>

13:21.480 --> 13:24.650
<b>It seems Miss Kaoru had a good read
about this place, that she did.</b>

13:24.950 --> 13:26.570
<b>What's wrong, Mr. Nishiwaki?</b>

13:27.490 --> 13:29.620
<b>Who's that shrimp?</b>

13:29.620 --> 13:32.330
<b>Oh, it's just some rat.</b>

13:34.040 --> 13:35.790
<b>Take care of 'im.</b>

13:37.500 --> 13:39.420
<b>Oh, no. It broke on its own.</b>

13:40.920 --> 13:42.090
<b>Miss Kaoru.</b>

13:42.670 --> 13:43.800
<b>Oh, it's you, Kihei.</b>

13:44.510 --> 13:45.880
<b>What's the matter?</b>

13:45.880 --> 13:48.390
<b>Why, yes, about this land and estate...</b>

13:49.550 --> 13:52.470
<b>I've been telling you
I don't plan to close this dojo.</b>

13:52.470 --> 13:54.350
<b>But as you can see here...</b>

13:54.810 --> 13:57.560
<b>TRANSFER OF LAND AND BUILDING DOCUMENT</b>

13:55.100 --> 13:57.560
<b>all the paperwork
has already been completed.</b>

13:58.480 --> 13:59.650
<b>Kihei?</b>

13:59.650 --> 14:02.400
<b>And all we need is one stamp from you.</b>

14:03.030 --> 14:07.110
<b>With that,
this land and estate will become ours!</b>

14:09.530 --> 14:10.450
<b>Yo!</b>

14:11.580 --> 14:12.410
<b>You're...</b>

14:13.080 --> 14:14.910
<b>Gohei Hiruma.</b>

14:14.910 --> 14:16.870
<b>He's my little brother.</b>

14:19.210 --> 14:23.460
<b>If you're doing it, do it legally.
That is my motto.</b>

14:23.460 --> 14:25.840
<b>But since you caught on
to my brother's true identity,</b>

14:25.840 --> 14:27.760
<b>I couldn't keep saying that.</b>

14:28.050 --> 14:32.600
<b>Playing the role of a good-natured old man
to gain trust went according to plan.</b>

14:32.600 --> 14:37.140
<b>You're a sucker for things, but really
stubborn when it comes to swordsmanship.</b>

14:37.310 --> 14:41.020
<b>So I had my brother cause
a commotion with crossroad killings</b>

14:41.020 --> 14:43.230
<b>to tarnish the name of your sword style.</b>

14:43.230 --> 14:46.900
<b>Using the Hitokiri Battosai's name
worked well in our favor, too,</b>

14:46.900 --> 14:48.780
<b>despite the fact he is
a legendary manslayer</b>

14:48.780 --> 14:50.820
<b>whose existence is dubious at best.</b>

14:50.950 --> 14:54.410
<b>Thanks to that,
we got this far in just two months.</b>

14:54.910 --> 14:57.620
<b>The value of the lands around here
will grow five- or six-fold</b>

14:57.620 --> 14:59.710
<b>thanks to the westernization policy.</b>

14:59.710 --> 15:02.710
<b>It's too good for some kendo dojo
to be standing here.</b>

15:03.170 --> 15:04.000
<b>Kihei...</b>

15:04.500 --> 15:06.920
<b>I heard from my bro.</b>

15:06.920 --> 15:11.050
<b>Your mission is a life-giving sword?</b>

15:11.050 --> 15:12.140
<b>How amusing.</b>

15:12.140 --> 15:15.220
<b>Why don't you try
saving yourself with it first?</b>

15:18.980 --> 15:23.310
<b>As expected, the sword of a little girl
talking in her sleep doesn't work on me.</b>

15:29.240 --> 15:32.490
<b>Existing for violence,
and murder is at its soul!</b>

15:32.490 --> 15:34.910
<b>That is the true nature of swordsmanship!</b>

15:35.490 --> 15:36.580
<b>Ow.</b>

15:36.580 --> 15:39.410
<b>And now this land and estate are ours.</b>

15:40.290 --> 15:43.210
<b>It's all over
for the so-called Kamiya Kasshin-ryu .</b>

15:45.670 --> 15:47.130
<b>What's wrong, Nishiwaki?</b>

15:48.710 --> 15:51.050
<b>H-He's strong.</b>

15:53.590 --> 15:55.350
<b>R-Rurouni!</b>

15:55.850 --> 15:57.310
<b>Sorry I'm late.</b>

15:57.810 --> 15:59.600
<b>I heard the entire story.</b>

16:00.560 --> 16:02.230
<b>You again?</b>

16:02.560 --> 16:08.030
<b>Do you mouth off about life-giving swords
just like this girl does?</b>

16:08.030 --> 16:08.900
<b>No.</b>

16:10.030 --> 16:11.740
<b>Swords are weapons.</b>

16:11.740 --> 16:13.570
<b>Swordsmanship is a means of murder.</b>

16:14.070 --> 16:18.950
<b>No matter how you sugarcoat it
or have lofty ideals, that is the truth.</b>

16:21.790 --> 16:23.870
<b>Miss Kaoru talks a sweet, naïve lie</b>

16:23.870 --> 16:29.130
<b>spoken only by those who have never
had blood on their hands, that she does.</b>

16:29.800 --> 16:30.630
<b>Rurouni.</b>

16:31.550 --> 16:34.760
<b>But in the face of such awful truth...</b>

16:36.140 --> 16:40.100
<b>I much prefer
Miss Kaoru's naïve lies, that I do.</b>

16:41.310 --> 16:46.810
<b>I wish that her lie could become
the truth of this world, that I do.</b>

16:47.480 --> 16:51.780
<b>Hey, bro, you don't mind me
killin' this guy off, do you?</b>

16:51.780 --> 16:54.820
<b>Yeah. You can torture him to death.</b>

16:55.070 --> 16:56.370
<b>Hey, boys!</b>

16:56.370 --> 16:57.200
<b>- Yeah!
- Yeah!</b>

16:57.200 --> 16:58.530
<b>Rurouni, make a run for it!</b>

16:58.830 --> 17:01.330
<b>I don't want to recklessly increase
the number of injured.</b>

17:01.910 --> 17:05.880
<b>If you don't want to go see a doctor,
be quick and retreat, that you will.</b>

17:05.880 --> 17:07.790
<b>Nobody here will be injured!</b>

17:07.790 --> 17:10.210
<b>The only injury will be a fatality, yours!</b>

17:15.380 --> 17:18.850
<b>Impossible! One swing, and he
takes down four, even five at once!</b>

17:18.850 --> 17:20.810
<b>I-Is this some sort of sorcery?</b>

17:20.970 --> 17:24.520
<b><i>No, it's not sorcery. This is...</i></b>

17:25.440 --> 17:26.730
<b><i>speed!</i></b>

17:26.730 --> 17:33.070
<b><i>Sword speed, speed of posture,
and speed of reading opponent movements.</i></b>

17:33.440 --> 17:36.160
<b><i>Making full use of every type of speed</i></b>

17:36.160 --> 17:40.990
<b><i>to simultaneously take down
multiple opponents with minimal movement!</i></b>

17:42.080 --> 17:44.210
<b>I forgot to mention one thing.</b>

17:44.750 --> 17:48.920
<b>The sword of Hitokiri Battosai
is not that of Kamiya Kasshin-ryu.</b>

17:49.210 --> 17:52.670
<b>It is an ancient sword art
with its roots in the Sengoku Era.</b>

17:53.210 --> 17:55.880
<b>The sword style name
is Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu.</b>

17:56.760 --> 17:59.140
<b>It excels in one-versus-many combat.</b>

17:59.680 --> 18:01.760
<b>If it weren't for me
having a sword like this,</b>

18:01.760 --> 18:03.770
<b>it is surely lethal.</b>

18:04.270 --> 18:07.100
<b>It is a murderous sword at godly speed,
that it is.</b>

18:07.310 --> 18:10.230
<b>No way. Then you are the Hitokiri Bat—</b>

18:10.980 --> 18:15.280
<b>Interesting!
I didn't take you on the other day,</b>

18:15.280 --> 18:17.700
<b>but I didn't think you were this strong!</b>

18:18.740 --> 18:21.450
<b>You were holding back against me!</b>

18:21.950 --> 18:25.960
<b>Unlike you,
I don't like to be violent all that much.</b>

18:26.290 --> 18:30.290
<b>But now I'm thinking
I should have slammed you down back then.</b>

18:30.540 --> 18:32.250
<b>That's quite the confidence.</b>

18:32.630 --> 18:35.130
<b>But that's what people
call being conceited!</b>

18:35.460 --> 18:38.470
<b>This world doesn't need two Battosais!</b>

18:41.470 --> 18:42.600
<b>Over here.</b>

18:51.650 --> 18:54.440
<b>I have no remorse nor attachment
to the name "Battosai."</b>

18:54.940 --> 18:58.650
<b>Even then, I cannot
hand it down to someone like you.</b>

19:00.780 --> 19:04.660
<b>You were the mastermind,
so you're not getting off so easy.</b>

19:13.750 --> 19:14.960
<b>Good grief.</b>

19:15.420 --> 19:16.420
<b>TRANSFER OF LAND AND BUILDING DOCUMENT</b>

19:15.920 --> 19:17.800
<b>The more someone schemes,</b>

19:18.170 --> 19:20.510
<b>the more cowardly
their true nature is, that they are.</b>

19:22.760 --> 19:25.100
<b>Miss Kaoru, I am sorry, that I am.</b>

19:25.640 --> 19:28.980
<b>I had no intention of fooling you
or hiding anything.</b>

19:29.600 --> 19:34.440
<b>But if I could help it, I would have liked
to not talk about this, that I would.</b>

19:35.650 --> 19:37.610
<b>Pardon me. Fare you well.</b>

19:38.860 --> 19:41.110
<b>H-H-Hold it right there!</b>

19:41.410 --> 19:44.870
<b>You expect me to bring the sword style
back up and running all by myself?</b>

19:44.870 --> 19:47.500
<b>You could at least give me
a bit of a helping hand!</b>

19:47.660 --> 19:50.750
<b>I'm not particular about people's pasts!</b>

19:52.000 --> 19:53.500
<b>I advise against it.</b>

19:54.000 --> 19:56.300
<b>This is your chance to clear your name.</b>

19:56.420 --> 19:58.050
<b>If the real Battosai were to linger,</b>

19:58.050 --> 20:00.260
<b>it would make everything for naught,
that it will.</b>

20:00.260 --> 20:02.680
<b>I'm not saying I want the Battosai
to stay here with me.</b>

20:02.680 --> 20:04.550
<b>I want you, a rurouni, to be here—</b>

20:05.760 --> 20:09.230
<b>F-Fine! If you want to go, just go!</b>

20:09.930 --> 20:13.940
<b>But at the least,
you can tell me your name before you go!</b>

20:14.400 --> 20:17.320
<b>Battosai is your past warrior name,
isn't it?</b>

20:18.400 --> 20:22.610
<b>Or do you not even want
to tell me your true name?</b>

20:29.120 --> 20:30.080
<b>Kenshin.</b>

20:32.250 --> 20:33.580
<b>Kenshin Himura.</b>

20:34.630 --> 20:37.090
<b>That is my current name, that it is.</b>

20:38.170 --> 20:40.800
<b>I am a bit tired of traveling.</b>

20:41.130 --> 20:44.760
<b>As a rurouni, I don't know
when I will wander to the next place.</b>

20:45.260 --> 20:46.640
<b>But if that's fine with you...</b>

20:47.140 --> 20:49.470
<b>I will stay here for the time being,
that I will.</b>

20:52.730 --> 20:54.440
<b><i>The beginning of the heroic tale...</i></b>

20:54.940 --> 20:58.270
<b><i>is in the 11th year of Meiji
in downtown Tokyo.</i></b>

20:58.770 --> 21:02.400
<b><i>It began with the arrival of a rurouni,
Kenshin Himura.</i></b>

21:04.610 --> 21:05.610
<b>Hold on just a minute.</b>

21:05.990 --> 21:08.370
<b>If you were a warrior
back in the Bakumatsu Era,</b>

21:08.370 --> 21:09.450
<b>exactly how old are you?</b>

21:09.830 --> 21:12.660
<b>You can't possibly be over 30
with that face, can you?</b>

21:12.870 --> 21:13.830
<b>Oro?</b>

22:45.090 --> 22:50.090
<b>NEXT EPISODE
TOKYO SAMURAI •
YAHIKO MYOJIN</b>

22:46.130 --> 22:49.340
<b><i>Next episode:
"Tokyo Samurai Yahiko Myojin."</i></b>
